358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.7, "y": 30.7, "width": 74.1, "height": 19, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.7, "y": 30.7, "width": 74.1, "height": 19, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.7, "y": 30.7, "width": 74.1, "height": 19, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Defn: A Turing Enumerator is a deterministic TM with a printer.\nIt starts on a blank tape and it can print strings w1, w2, w3, ... possibly going forever.\nIts language is the set of all strings it prints. It is a generator, not a recognizer.\nFor enumerator E we say L(E) = {w| E prints w}."]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.9, "y": 51.3, "width": 58.7, "height": 4.8, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.9, "y": 51.3, "width": 58.7, "height": 4.8, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0.9, "y": 51.3, "width": 58.7, "height": 4.8, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Theorem: A is T-recognizable iff A = L(E) for some T-enumerator E."]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.8, "y": 60.8, "width": 12.7, "height": 4.2, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.8, "y": 60.8, "width": 12.7, "height": 4.2, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.8, "y": 60.8, "width": 12.7, "height": 4.2, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Check-in 6.1 "]}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.5, "y": 65.9, "width": 40.5, "height": 17.6, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_7", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.5, "y": 65.9, "width": 40.5, "height": 17.6, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_7", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.5, "y": 65.9, "width": 40.5, "height": 17.6, "rotation": 0, "text": ["When converting TM M to enumerator E,\ndoes E always print the strings in string order?\na) Yes.\nb) No."]}, "id": "BB_7", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 44.8, "y": 58.3, "width": 54.5, "height": 31.9, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_8", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 44.8, "y": 58.3, "width": 54.5, "height": 31.9, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_8", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 44.8, "y": 58.3, "width": 54.5, "height": 31.9, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Proof: (\u2192) Convert TM M to equivalent enumerator E.\nE = Simulate M on each wi in \u03a3* = {\u03b5, 0,1,00,01,10, ...}\nWhenever E prints x, test x = w.\nAccept if x = w and continue otherwise.\nProblem: What if M on wi loops?\nFix: Simulate M on w1, w2, ..., wi for i steps, for i = 1,2, ...\nPrint those wi which are accepted."]}, "id": "BB_8", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 88.92763731473408, "y": 93.51575399511965, "width": 11.072362685265915, "height": 6.484246004880347, "rotation": 0}, "id": "o78BVnhScV", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 88.92763731473408, "y": 93.51575399511965, "width": 11.072362685265915, "height": 6.484246004880347, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "o78BVnhScV", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 88.92763731473408, "y": 93.51575399511965, "width": 11.072362685265915, "height": 6.484246004880347, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Check-in 6.1"]}, "id": "o78BVnhScV", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 0, "y": 97.25638415492443, "width": 5.318221447253705, "height": 2.743615845075541, "rotation": 0}, "id": "kxQCCJgHHS", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "va